ural network. Overall, these results may provide insights into how the nervous system optimally encodes sequences of items.  ","topics":[],"score":180414,"global_rank":430360},{"name":"laurinalastella/dabc","owner":"laurinalastella","html_url":"https://github.com/laurinalastella/dabc","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180414,"global_rank":430361},{"name":"ianliuy/Simple-Distributed-System","owner":"ianliuy","html_url":"https://github.com/ianliuy/Simple-Distributed-System","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180414,"global_rank":430362},{"name":"johannavo97/SBA_FRONTEND","owner":"johannavo97","html_url":"https://github.com/johannavo97/SBA_FRONTEND","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180414,"global_rank":430363},{"name":"kcmuse/first-repo-kc","owner":"kcmuse","html_url":"https://github.com/kcmuse/first-repo-kc","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180414,"global_rank":430364},{"name":"mattman206/introducction-to-github","owner":"mattman206","html_url":"https://github.com/mattman206/introducction-to-github","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180414,"global_rank":430365},{"name":"jstoecker/dxcompute-docs","owner":"jstoecker","html_url":"https://github.com/jstoecker/dxcompute-docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Survey of DX12 compute topics","topics":[],"score":180414,"global_rank":430366},{"name":"Tekthree/reading-notes-401","owner":"Tekthree","html_url":"https://github.com/Tekthree/reading-notes-401","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Reading notes for code 401","topics":[],"score":180414,"global_rank":430367},{"name":"burcu-erkan/restaurant-menu-react"